leg (i.e., not execute assemble_origin_loaded_leg etc). We'll just assemble a plain transport leg (assemble_transport_leg) which does not set origin_leg_loaded or destination_leg_loaded. Then we can load container onto leg (loading_container_leg_linked). That does not set origin_leg_loaded/destination_leg_loaded. So we can use establish_clearance_nominal.)
